  "content": "\n\n<h1><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdathost.net%252fr%252fbareneil%252fminecraft-server-hosting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1475587/description_7bacedcb-1d61-4bd0-8d04-cb8a0b267406.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"81\"></a></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>為 Eating Animations 與 Farmer's Delight 模組的食物，以及其他部分 Farmer's Delight 主題模組變體之間新增相容性</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Bundle 材質包相容</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animation-more-mod-compatibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Eating Animations More Mod Compatibility[NEO/FORGE]</a> &amp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animation-more-mod-compatibility-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[FABRIC]</a></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animation-more-mod-compatibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1751/483/639114741005949896.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"153\" height=\"153\"></em></a><em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animation-more-mod-compatibility-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1748/995/639113051020661900.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"153\" height=\"153\"></a></em></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong>部分其他相容性：</strong></em></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animations-quark-compatibility\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1816/885/256/256/639148225207339732.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animations-aether-compatibility\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1816/866/256/256/639148221311503481.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animations-x-born-in-chaos\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1816/873/256/256/639148222209502373.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animations-x-farmers-delight-add-ons\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1816/875/256/256/639148223190593815.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animations-x-twilight-forest\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1816/879/256/256/639148224173941263.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animations-x-artifacts\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1813/752/256/256/639146533871866822.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a></p>\n<p><strong>為搭配 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eating-animation-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Eating Animations(NEO/FORGE)</a> &amp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eating-animation-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">(FABRIC)</a> 或 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modefite-item-definition-backport\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modefite</a> 的模組新增相容性</strong></p>\n<h3><strong>模組相容列表：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aether Delight</a></strong><strong>&nbsp;（已移至 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animations-aether-compatibility\" rel=\"nofollow\">Eating Animations x Aether</a>）</strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fartifacts-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Artifacts Delight</a></strong><strong>&nbsp;（已移至 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animations-x-artifacts\" rel=\"nofollow\">Eating Animations x Artifacts</a>）</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Born In Chaos Delight（已移至&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animations-x-born-in-chaos\" rel=\"nofollow\">Eating Animations x Born In Chaos</a>）</strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enders-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ender's Delight</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Delight [Forge]</a></strong><strong>/<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight-refabricated\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[Fabric]</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mineral-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Mineral Delight</strong></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nethers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nether's Delight</a></strong><strong>/<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nethers-delight-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">[Fabric]</a><br></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oceans-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ocean's Delight</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quark-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quark Delight</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/twilights-flavors-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twilight's Flavors & Delight</a>&nbsp;</strong><strong>（已移至 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animations-x-twilight-forest\" rel=\"nofollow\">Eating Animations x Twilight Forest</a>）</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>相容版本：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>1.16.x, </strong><strong>1.17.x, </strong><strong>1.18.x,&nbsp;</strong><strong>1.19.x,&nbsp;</strong><strong>1.20.x,&nbsp;</strong><strong>1.21.x, 26.x</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_3f0a1c89-cb57-47ab-9875-aa6dd5c91527.png\"></strong></p>\n<div>\n<div style=\"width:300px;font-size:13px\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>",
